OL,3,GNEWSANew police chief pledges to
OL,4,Aimprove performance
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new police chief constable has
OL,7,Fpledged to ensure officers are "at
OL,8,Ftheir best" and are there "when people
OL,9,Fare at their worst".
OL,11,FKaty Barrow-Grint, the new chief of
OL,12,FGloucestershire Police, previously led
OL,13,FThames Valley Police's response to
OL,14,Fviolence against women and girls before
OL,15,Fshe joined her current force as deputy
OL,16,Fchief constable in 2024.
OL,18,FShe said she joined during a "crisis of
OL,19,Fleadership" and, despite a recent
OL,20,Fcritical report into the force's
OL,21,Fperformance, was confident she could
OL,22,Fmake improvements.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
