OL,3,GNEWSANew police chief pledges to
OL,4,Aimprove performance
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I hope what I bring as the new chief
OL,7,Fconstable is some stability, some
OL,8,Facknowledgement that I've been here
OL,9,Fover the last couple of years to unpick
OL,10,Fall of those problems," she said.
